== Sweets Festival 2024 == 

#Find Festival Chairman Chocolate in {{Navi|prontera|163|98}} and listen to their plight. You will be tasked with finding 10 {{monster|id=3790 Sweet Drops}} that ran away with the cacao beans and defeating them.
#After defeating the enemies, report back to Chocolate. Chocolate will then ask you to turn in {{Item List|id=25292|item=Stolen Cocoa Beans|simple=yes|num=20}}, which were dropped by the Sweet Drops when you defeated them. The festival chairman will also reward you with 20 Sweets Festival Coins and one of the following sweets:
##{{Item List|id=11607|item=Sweet Crepe|simple=yes}}
##{{Item List|id=23259|item=Strawberry Cream Cupcake|simple=yes}}
##{{Item List|id=23260|item=Fruit Parfait|simple=yes}}
##Montblanc Cake
##{{Item List|id=23261|item=Chewy Macaron|simple=yes}}
#Turn in the 20 Stolen Cocoa Beans to Festival Chairman Chocolate, and you will be rewarded with an additional 30 Sweets Festival Coins and another random sweet item.

== Delivery and Collection == 

#After completing the previous quests, Festival Chairman Chocolate will ask for your assistance in delivering chocolates to sweets stores in different cities. You will be given 5 Product Chocolates and a list of locations to visit. Chocolate will also ask you to retrieve special products prepared by each store when you visit them.
#Make your deliveries to the shops in:
##{{Navi|prontera|114|102}}
##{{Navi|geffen|59|165}}
##{{Navi|payon|160|126}}
##{{Navi|aldebaran|169|183}}
##{{Navi|morocc|170|75}}
#You can do them in any order that you wish. After delivering the chocolate to each NPC and receiving their specialized sweets, you can buy more of their sweets or exchange 10 Sweets Festival Coins to draw a random sweet from them.
#Along with the sweets you've already seen from the quests, here are other items that you can draw when you exchange the 10 Sweets Festival Coins:
##Soccer Cake
##Strawberry Cream Cake
##{{Item List|id=19683|item=Costume Sweet Candy|simple=yes}}
##{{Item List|id=31195|item=Costume Mini Chocolat Hat|simple=yes}}
##(Not for Sale) Lucky Candy
##{{Item List|id=20470|item=Costume Sweet Chocolate Hat|simple=yes}}
##White Chocolate

==  Special Order To Share Sweetness == 

#Once you've finished delivering the chocolates and collecting all the different sweets, pay a visit to Festival Chairman Chocolate again. Chocolate will reward you with 10 Sweets Festival Coins and ask you to do one final delivery. In the spirit of the Sweets Festival, Chocolate asks you to delivery all the sweets you collected to different children. You will be given another list of NPCs to visit. Don't give into the temptation of eating the sweets yourself, or you will have to cover the costs for replacements!
##Crepe gift to Cherry {{Navi|prontera|225|346}}
##Cupcake gift to Blossom {{Navi|prontera|225|322}}
##Parfait gift to Walnuts {{Navi|prontera|210|338}}
##Macaron gift to Cinnamon {{Navi|prontera|255|311}}
##Montblanc gift to Hazel {{Navi|prontera|236|308}}
