=Access=
After being at least '''level 190''', to access the dungeon you need to go to '''Abyss Lake Entrance''' with either {{plainlink |url=https://irowiki.org/wiki/Abyss_Lake_Entrance_Guide Abyss Lake Entrance Guide}} or '''Dungeon Teleporter''' inside Morroc Eden Group {{navi|moc_para01|13|28}}.

Then head to '''Abyss Lake Dungeon F3''', the portal to the 4th floor is located at {{navi|abyss_03|91|110}}.
[[File:ABYSS4 MINIMAP.png|frame|right|F4 Dungeon Entrance]]
[[File:ABYSS4 ENTRANCE NPC.png|frame|left]]

