12. Go to Juno and talk to the Active Little Girl, Hisa {{Navi|yuno|208|164}}. She will tell that the famous doctor Cylmel has just returned.

13. Go to the house of the doctor{{Navi|yuno|246|143}}but she will chase you out. Keep trying to enter until she lets you. Talk to her and choose options: do you like traveling? Talk again and say you're so beautiful, I have a favor to ask. You may have to do this several times.  

14. Return to the Geffen Inn and talk to the granddaughter {{Navi|geffen_in|106|106}}. Keep asking about her health until she tells you her symptoms.

15. Head back to the doctor in Juno and answer her questions. Temperature: repeatedly turns hot and cold, not sweating at all, paralyzed often, irregular heart beat.

16. The doctor will ask you to gather some items:

* 2 {{Item List|id=608 |item=Yggdrasil Seed|simple=yes}}
* 3 {{Item List|id=704 |item=Aloe|simple=yes}}
* 1 {{Item List|id=748 |item=Witherless Rose|simple=yes}}
* 10 {{Item List|id=1061 |item=Witch Starsand|simple=yes}}
* 5 {{Item List|id=7097 |item=Burning Heart|simple=yes}}
* 5 {{Item List|id=7066 |item=Ice Cubic|simple=yes}} 

After giving her the items, she'll give you an {{Item List|id=606 |item=Aloevera|simple=yes}}.

17. Return to the Geffen Inn and give the medicine to the granddaughter. Then talk to the Blacksmith.

18. The Blacksmith will tell you to gather some items:

* 1 Type of {{item|id=986 Anvil}}
* 5 {{Item List|id=7110 |item=Broken Sword|simple=yes}}
* 2 {{Item List|id=756 |item=Rough Oridecon|simple=yes}}
* 2 {{Item List|id=999 |item=Steel|simple=yes}}
* 1 {{Item List|id=1005 |item=Hammer of Blacksmith|simple=yes}}
* 2 {{Item List|id=1000 |item=Star Crumb|simple=yes}}
* 5 {{Item List|id=7098 |item=Live Coal|simple=yes}}

Give them to the Blacksmith, you'll receive Sa Yun Moon's sword which is a {{Item List|id=1123 |item=Haedonggun|simple=yes}}.
* Note: ''Simply buying the sword from an NPC does not work.''

19. Return the sword to the Chief and you will receive {{Item List|id=2406 |item=Boots[1]|simple=yes}} or {{Item List|id=2404 |item=Shoes[1]|simple=yes}}.

