===Trick for Bio5 Hats for Box 6===
Two Bio5 costume hats, {{Item_List_2 |id=19974 |item=Costume Camouflage Bunny Hood |simple=yes}} and {{Item_List_2 |id=19969 |item=Costume Blazing Soul |simple=yes}} are in two boxes' list. To get Box 6, do the following:
#Put ONLY those two costumes in your inventory, highly suggested to practice with only 1 costume in bag if new to this.
#When the NPC asks the costume to be exchanged, choose '''Look for something else'''.
#Then the same dialogue appears for the 2nd time, this time you choose exchange to get Box 6.
#*When having multiple of these costume headgears in the bag, remember which is the 1st and 2nd exchanging dialogue. Always pick the 2nd to get Box 6.

==Exchanging from Stones==
'''Katnipped''' {{navi|mal_in01|28|225}} will accept 3 enchant stone of the same type in exchange for a new random enchant stone.

[[File:Katnipped.png]]

==Treasure Box Drop==
Treasure boxes in [[Wave Mode]] Dungeon Sky Mode have a chance to drop the following stones below. Other stones can only be obtained from exchanging costume method.
*CRI Stone (Slot 1)
*HP+50 Stone (Slot 2)
*Magic Stone (Slot 2)

