==Quests for Crystals==
{{repeatable|cooldown=23 hour}}

Despite the in-game description, there are no maximum level requirements for any of the following quests. This means that level 100+ characters can do 3 quests per 23 hours to gain 10 Rough, 10 Purified and 5/10 High Energy Crystals.

===Rough Energy Crystals===
For levels 61+<br/>
The following quests will provide 10 '''Rough Energy Crystals''' 
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1164 Requiem}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1102 Bathory}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1322 Spring Rabbit}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1386 Sleeper}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1117 Evil Druid}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1155 Petite (Ground)}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1269 Clock}}

===Purified Energy Crystals===
For levels 80+<br/>
The following quests will provide 10 '''Purified Energy Crystals''' 
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1776 Siroma}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1198 Dark Priest}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1784 Stapo}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1316 Solider}}

===High Energy Crystals===
For levels 90+<br/>
The following quests will provide 5 '''High Energy Crystals''' 
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1106 Desert Wolf}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1148 Medusa}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1995 Pinguicula}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1310 Majoruros}}

For levels 100+<br/>
The following quests will provide 10 '''High Energy Crystals'''
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1163 Raydric}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1993 Naga}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1297 Ancient Mummy}}
*Kill 100 {{monster|id=1699 Ancient Mimic}}

'''Cooldown quest name:''' High level collectiong request[Stand by]

