=Access=
There are two ways to access the map:
* '''Dungeon Teleporter''' inside [[Eden Group]], teleport to [[Glast Heim]].
* Ask someone to give a [[Warp Portal]] to inside the map.
* Be at least level 175, go to [[Glast Heim]], talk to '''Magician Nillem''' {{navi|glast_01|189|272}} , and select '''Let's go!'''


[[File:AGH ACCESS NPC.png|frame|left]]
{{clear}}

=Daily Quest=
There are 3 available daily quest here and they all can be taken at once. Talk to '''Magician Nillem''' {{navi|glast_01|189|272}} and select '''What i found'''.

You have 4 options to choose:
* [[Abyss_Glast_Heim#An_Empty_Thing|An Empty Thing]]
* [[Abyss_Glast_Heim#A Thing with High Freezing Point|A Thing with High Freezing Point]]
* [[Abyss_Glast_Heim#A Thing Like A Mirror|A Thing Like A Mirror]]
* Well, i'm Okay. (end the dialogue)

