== Castle Investment ==
Your castle needs to have an economy of 30 or higher in order to begin the quest since completing the quest removes 20 economy.

== Overview ==
There is a time limit of one hour to complete the quest. There is no death penalty inside the dungeon.<br />
Any member of the guild may enter the dungeon as long as they meet the [[War of Emperium Training Edition#Restrictions|restrictions for War of Emperium: Training Edition]]. Standard TE rules apply within the dungeon; therefore [[Guild Skills]] are available.<br />
'''You cannot start the quest 4 hours before WOE TE, and cannot proceed during the siege.'''


