== Investing with Zeny ==
# Speak with the '''Cat Paw Merchant Guild''' in the realm you wish to invest in {{Navi|prt_gld|158|96}} (below the fountain). 
# Select '''I want to invest in this area'''. 
# Select '''Invest with Zeny'''. 
# You will then be given the option of units in 1, 10, 50, or another amount you can choose (1-200).
# Each unit will be rewarded as a '''Thanks Invest Ticket'''.
#* Each unit represents 10,000 [[Zeny]] 
#* These tickets are <font color="red"> account-bound </font> and can be redeemed for items later on.

== Investing with Items ==
