== Entering the New Dungeons ==
To enter the new dungeons you may speak with the '''Gate Manager''' [[NPC]] near the [[NPC]] you used to invest in the realm. You may only do this '''after''' the investment period is over and the gate has been connected. This [[NPC]] will then allow access to floor 1 and 2 of the Guild Dungeons. Members of guilds owning a castle in the realm may use the same [[NPC]] that allows them to invest inside of their current castle. There is also a status board near each of these '''Gate Managers''' to show the current investment status in that realm.


