=== Enchant: Job Skills ===
*Glacier weapons can have one 4th job '''and/or''' one 3rd Job enchant.
*Dim Glacier[1] weapons will ''ALWAYS'' have at least one 4th Job enchant.
**Dim can have two 4th Job
**Dim can have one 4th Job and one 3rd Job

=== Total Costs ===
Assuming you purchase everything and never touch the maps to hunt the materials or quests to receive items, here is the total amounts you need to fully enchant a Dim Glacier Weapon to Lv5+full slot {3}{4} enchants using just the npc exchange.
*Infested Mana Ore - 1,110
*Snow Flower Petal - 15,920
*Amethyst Fragment - 79,600
*Snow Flower Ores - 542,275
*Venomous Mana - 6

However, the total quantities needed without breaking it down to it's pure raw materials:
*Shining Snow Flower Magic Stone - 75
*Brilliant Snow Flower Magic Stone - 120
*Glacier Extract - 225
*Infested Mana Crystal - 37
*Stabilized Mana Crystal - 37
*Snowflower Mana Vial - 105
*Glowing Snowflower Mana Vial - 140
*Brilliant Snowflower Mana Vial - 185
*Venomous Mana - 6

