'''Madogear''' is a class of magic-powered, armored suit that can only be worn by [[mechanic]]s. While wearing it, mechanics gain the ability to use Madogear-exclusive skills, but lose the ability to use almost all non-mechanic skills.

Madogear have the following characteristics:
*Can't receive healing from any recovery skills other than [[Repair]].
*Movement speed can't be increased or decreased by any means other than [[Acceleration]]. Madogear is immune to all slow debuffs, including [[curse]] status.
*Immune to [[Divest Accessory]]. 
*Increased movement speed based on level of [[Madogear License]]. On level 5, movement speed is equal to [[Peco Peco Ride]].
*Have natural HP recovery like normal state.
*Weight limit increased by 1500.
*Slim Style Madogear is available from Madogear Merchant in Weapon shops across towns.

