== Mounting and dismounting ==
You can rent Madogear for free from the '''Magic Gear Master''' in Prontera {{Navi|prontera|163|178}} or Eden Group Headquarters {{Navi|moc_para01|16|30}}, providing you have level 1 or higher of [[Madogear License]]. To dismount Madogear, open your equipment window then click '<strong>off</strong>'.

The items {{Item|id=23277 Mado Emergency Box}} and {{Item|id=100158 Mado Emergency Box (Reinforced)}} can also be used to equip a Madogear, regular or slim respectively, and can be bought at a '''Madogear Merchant''' inside a '''Tool Dealer Shop''' for 10,000 zeny.
*'''Note''': Do not buy the Emergency Madogear from the '''Madogear Manager''' in Prontera; it costs 1 million zeny.
*Mechanics and Meisters who have learned the [[Madogear License]] skill can instantly equip a Madogear.
*Mado Emergency Box and Reinforced have 3 minutes cooldown and 300 weight.

