#Talk to '''Senior Tracker'''{{navi|moro_cav|61|69}}.
#:[[File:mc_SeniorTracker.png|250px]]
#Talk to '''Red Flower''' {{navi|moro_cav|50|64}} to reserve and enter the instance.
#In the first room, you need to kill all 9 Morroc's Ghouls, then Reaper Yanku will appear and talk.
#In the second room, you will fight Weakened Satan Morroc (this one is very easy, only sports 1.7m HP and no threat).
#After the talk, your party will be split into two teams (The split may not be equal. For example if you have 4 members, the party might be split 3-1) and be moved to 2 versions of the third room. Each team will be trapped in ice wall (using [[Back Slide]], [[Front Slide]], [[Dark Illusion]] or [[Warg Strike]] will let you out of the ice wall) while a swarm of mobs will attack. Each team should kill certain amount of mobs to proceed. Make sure both teams are able to finish the task, since if one team fails, the whole party will fail and be moved to Prontera.
#In the fourth room, your party will be reunited again, and still trapped in ice wall. The situation is similar to third room. Swarm of mobs and need to kill certain amount to complete.
#In the fifth room, a [https://www.divine-pride.net/database/monster/2999/morocc-necromancer Morrocc Necromancer] will appear, He is still on astral mode sporting 4m HP. 
#After you kill it, it will transform into his true form, [https://www.divine-pride.net/database/monster/3000/morocc-necromancer Morocc Necromancer]. This form has 80m HP and is stationary. He casts skills like Jack Frost and Meteor Storm. While killing him, a swarm of mobs will appear. 
#*Kill the Morroc Wraiths because once they reach you, they self-destruct and kill you.
#Once his HP reach 3m, he will speak "you can never kill me". At this rate, you need to kill him within 30 seconds. Else, he will restore his HP back to 3m and the 30 seconds to kill period restarted. So, it is important if the party can do more than 100k damage per second to clear this instance.
#Once he dies, he will drop 2 {{item|id=22537 Prizes of Hero}}. Then a dimensional device will appear and move you to the fire cave. 
#Talk to '''Senior Tracker''' again to get a Token of Hero and '''to start the cooldown timer'''.

