== Nightmare Biolabs Headgear Enchantments ==

===Enchant Requirements ===
*The headgear must be equipped. All enchant processes are safe and will not break the headgear.
*The 3rd and 4th slots must be enchanted first before the 2nd slot can be enchanted.
*Speak to '''Wandering Grudge'''  {{Navi|lhz_dun_n|134|265}}  to start the enchanting process or '''<The Grave of the Warri>Hot Machine'''  {{Navi|lhz_d_n2|38|48}}  for the guaranteed 2nd slot enchant process.
**<The Grave of the Warri>Hot Machine is available only if you entered the map by paying Lunar 2,000,000 zeny.
*To reset enchant, pay {{Item List|id=22687|item=Sentimental Fragment|num=10|simple=y}} to '''Wandering Grudge'''  {{Navi|lhz_dun_n|134|265}}. 
**'''ALL''' enchantments are reset.

=== 3rd and 4th Slot Enchant ===
