===2nd Slot Enchant===
The second slot can be enchanted in two different ways, '''random''' or '''guaranteed''':
====Random====
If '''random''', it can either be a random stat enchant from the 3rd and 4th slot enchant table (like Dex +3) or one [[Nightmare_Biolabs_Headgear_Quests#Special_Enchants|Special Enchant]] from the tables below (like Acute). If it's a special enchant, it will start at level 1 and can be upgraded with {{Item List|id=23016|item=Cursed Fragments|simple=y}}. However, failing the upgrade will downgrade the enchant one level (down to a minimum level of 1).

