1. Prepare 1 {{item|id=716 Red Gemstone}} and 1 {{item|id=717 Blue Gemstone}}. You will use them, but they will be given back immediately.

2. Near {{navi|umbala|216|190}}, click the skull and look at it carefully. The skull is on/by the door.

3. It will ask you what you want to do. First in the left eye, '''Insert a Blue Gemstone'''. Then in the right eye, '''Insert a Red Gemstone'''.

4. You will be teleported into the room and should talk to the '''Utan Shaman'''.

5. Go to the leader's house {{navi|umbala|68|253}}, and talk to him. He'll ask you to bring him a {{item|id=2278 Mr. Smile}} as a gift. Give him one.

6. Now you may have the shaman process ore for you. Every time you enter her room you will need to put the gems into the skull again. She can break a pure Elemental Stone into lesser stones, or make a lesser elemental stone out of certain monster drops. Examples:

* Turn a {{item|id=996 Rough Wind}} into 6 - 10 {{item|id=992 Wind of Verdures}}

* Turn a {{item|id=995 Mystic Frozen}} into 6 - 10 {{item|id=991 Crystal Blues}} 

* Turn a {{item|id=994 Flame Heart}} into 6 - 10 {{item|id=990 Red Blood}} 

* Turn a {{item|id=997 Great Nature}} into 6 - 10 {{item|id=993 Green Lives}} 

* Turn 25 {{item|id=1013 Rainbow Shells}} into a {{item|id=992 Wind of Verdure}}

* Turn 20 {{item|id=946 Snail's Shells}} into a {{item|id=991 Crystal Blue}}

* Turn 20 {{item|id=904 Scorpion Tails}} into a {{item|id=990 Red Blood}}

* Turn 15 {{item|id=947 Horns }} into a {{item|id=993 Green Live}}



* Note: ''The amount of stones you get when breaking a pure stone will vary from 6 ~ 10.''
* Note: ''It is possible to fail and get nothing when, for example, turning 20 {{item|id=946 Snail's Shells}} into a {{item|id=991 Crystal Blue}}''

