== Hunting Guide for Materials ==
=== Monster Drops ===
* Red Herb : Best from {{monster|id=1005 Familiar}} (Payon Caves) or {{monster|id=1078 Red Plant}}.
* Yellow Herb : Best from {{monster|id=1188 Bongun}} (Payon Caves) or {{monster|id=1081 Yellow Plant}}.
* White Herb : Best from {{monster|id=1036 Ghoul}} ({{map|id=gl_church Glast Heim ST. Abbey}} & {{map|id=gl_chyard Churchyard}}), {{monster|id=1082 White Plant}}, {{monster|id=1367 Blazer}} and {{monster|id=1366 Lava Golem}} in [[Magma Dungeon]].
* Blue Herb : Found throughout Rune-Midgard, mainly through {{monster|id=1079 Blue Plant}}, {{monster|id=1372 Goat}} or {{monster|id=1061 Nightmare}}.
* Alcohol : Low drop from Mushroom and a few other monsters. Mostly created using [[Prepare Potion]] or [[Change Material]]. Equipping {{item|id=2976 Red Lantern}} will drop these when killing monsters.
* Stem : {{monster|id=1020 Mandragora}} (North of [[Geffen]]) and {{monster|id=1118 Flora}} ([[Geffen]] and [[Comodo]] Field).
* Poison Spore : {{monster|id=1077 Poison Spore}} ([[Geffen]] Field).
* Cactus Needle : {{monster|id=1055 Muka}} (two South of [[Prontera]]).
* Mole Whiskers : {{monster|id=1145 Martin}} (upper two levels of [[Coal Mine]]).
* Witch Starsand : {{monster|id=1102 Bathory}} ([[Clock Tower]] {{map|id=alde_dun04 Basement Level 4}}).
* Fabric : {{monster|id=1179 Whisper}} ([[Glast Heim]] or {{map |id=treasure01 Sunken Ship level 1}})
* Maneater Blossom : {{monster|id=1368 Geographer}} ([[Juno]] Fields) or Flora.
* Tendon : {{monster|id=1142 Marine Sphere}} (Izlude Dungeon {{map|id=iz_dun03 Level 3}} and {{map|id=iz_dun04 Level 4}}).
* Detonator : Marine Sphere.
* Immortal Heart : {{monster|id=1032 Verit}} (Pyramid). Equipping {{item|id=15044 Green Operation Coat}} & {{item|id=13027 Scalpel}} will drop these when killing Brute & Demi Human type monster.
* Zenorc Fang : {{monster|id=1177 Zenorc}} ({{map|id=orcsdun02 Orc Dungeon Level 2}}).
* Mermaid's Heart: {{monster|id=1044 Obeaune}} (Izlude Dungeon Level 3) & {{monster|id=2069 Iara}} (Brasilis Dungeon Level 2).
* Honey : Generally found from {{monster|id=1060 Bigfoot}} and Turtles.
* Aloe : {{monster|id=1080 Green Plant}}.
* Ment : Red Plant.

=== Buyable Materials ===
* Empty Potion Bottles : Found in the {{shop|id=gef_mage Mage Guild}} in Northwest [[Geffen]].
* Empty Test Tube : Found in the {{shop|id=gef_mage Mage Guild}} in Northwest [[Geffen]].
* Scell : Found in the {{shop|id=gef_trader Tool Shop}} in Southwest [[Geffen]].
* Medicine Bowl : Found in the Alchemist Guild in Southwest [[Al De Baran]].
* Empty Bottle : Found in most Tool Shops.
* Red Potion : Found in any Tool Shop in any town map.
* Yellow Potion : Found in any Tool Shop in any town map.
* White Potion : Found in any Tool Shop in any town map.
* Morning Dew of Yggdrasil : Found in the {{shop|id=alde_material Alchemist Guild}} in Southwest [[Al De Baran]].
* Seed of Life : Found in the {{shop|id=alde_material Alchemist Guild}} in Southwest [[Al De Baran]].
* Glass Tube : Found in the {{shop|id=alde_material Alchemist Guild}} in Southwest [[Al De Baran]].

== Fame System ==
For Brewers there is a system in which players are ranked based on who can create the most potions.
* '''Rank Point +1''': 3 Condensed Potions created without failure in a row.
* '''Rank Point +3''': 5 Condensed Potions created without failure in a row.
* '''Rank Point +10''': 7 Condensed Potions created without failure in a row.
* '''Rank Point +50''': 10 Condensed Potions created without failure in a row. 
* A fully successful brew from [[Spiritual_Potion_Creation_(variant_2)|Spiritual Potion Creation 2]] will grant 1280 points.

[[Alchemist]] ranks can be checked via usage of the <code>/alchemist</code> command ingame. Potions made by an [[Alchemist]] class player who is in the top 10 list will receive a 50% bonus to their efficacy. This does not apply to potions used through [[Aid Potion]] or [[Aid Condensed Potion]].

