'''Rune Midgard Allied Forces Post''' is a town in the [[New World]]. It provides access to the Splendide and Manuk field maps from where players can then reach the towns of [[Manuk]] or [[Splendide]].

There exists a language barrier that prevents you from understanding certain [[NPC]]s; primarily the [[Splendide|Laphine]] and the [[Manuk|Sapha]]. While some things can be done on new world maps despite a language barrier (i.e. [[Warlock]] job change), most everything else needs the character to perform the [[Ring of the Wise King]] quest in order to solve the language barrier.

== Quests ==
* See the section [[Quests#Into the Unknown Quests|Other World Allied Camp]] for available quests.

