# At Glast Heim you will find Clepto-Cal at the following locations, players will either obtain a book or not, Clepto-Cal will summon a {{monster |id=1195 rideword}} if a player successfully obtains a book or a {{monster |id=1151 myst}} if the player does not obtain a book.  After you find him at location 1, he will move to location 2, likewise from 2 to 3 and so on.
