In [[Alberta]], the leader of a [[Party]] can talk to '''Leticia''' {{Navi|alberta| 214|74}} to gain access to the Sunken Tower Instance. Talking to her again will produce the [[instance]] and set the Tower Ranking based on the Party's Leader's Base Level. Talking to her once more allows entrance to the Sunken Tower.

Once inside, the 30 minute (''observed to actually be around 29 minutes'') time limit begins. The Party Leader must talk to '''Leiticia''' to either start the instance immediately or to increase the Tower Difficulty for better EXP rewards before starting.

After 30 minutes have passed, all players in the instance will be warped out and sent back to '''Leticia''' in [[Alberta]].

=== Tower Ranking ===

'''Leticia''' will create an instance based on the Party Leader's [[Base Level]], which will decide the instance's "Rank". This Rank System is automatically selected for the player and cannot be modified. Level Range per Base Level below:

