== Tips & Tricks ==

=== Monster Hunting ===

* Monsters do not use any skills, only normal attacks, so [[Neutral]] reduction (like from a Raydric Card) works here. Also, high [[Perfect Dodge]] will help evade those attacks too.
* Monsters per floor are completely random in race / size / elemental property but no [[Neutral]] level 4 elemental monsters appear. That means using [[Ghost]] elemental damage will be able to hit all monsters in the instance without missing due to elemental disadvantage. Either way, it is important to make sure to bring/utilize some means to change your skill's elemental property to ensure you can kill all monsters that appear.

=== Resetting the Cooldown ===

Sunken Tower normally has a 3-day cooldown period but this can be circumvented via the [[Memorial Dungeon Reset Event 2025]] for Silvervine and Ether Dust to run repeatedly.


