== Yggdrasil Ascension ==

Yggdrasil Ascension is our new OCP Item System!

Buy the Tickets from the cash shop and take it to the Yggdrasil Tree Explorer located in the Eden Group.

The Explorer will take the ticket and give you your reward. Using the ticket will not consume it but teleport you to the Southern Gate of Prontera. Ticket Claiming is divided into 10 steps. Each step gives a specific reward and when you reach step 10 with the tickets it starts all over again.

Each Ticket Costs 300 pts<br>
Rewards:<br>
Each ticket when claimed will give a reward according to it's step.<br>
Step 1 Random Item from this Month's OCP List and 4 Bloody Branch<br>
Step 2 Random Item from this Month's OCP List<br>
Step 3 Random Item from this Month's OCP List<br>
Step 4 Random Item from this Month's OCP List<br>
Step 5 Guaranteed Random Gear with Semi Rare or Rare rarity from this Month's OCP List<br>
Step 6 Random Item from this Month's OCP List and 4 HE Bubble Gum<br>
Step 7 Random Item from this Month's OCP List<br>
Step 8 Random Item from this Month's OCP List<br>
Step 9 Random Item from this Month's OCP List<br>
Step 10 Guaranteed Random Gear with Rare rarity from this Month's OCP List

Exact lists for the archive, and featured list will be published during maintenance.

This means at by Step 10 you will have spent 3000kp and received the following<br>
8 Random OCP Items (Can Include consumables)<br>
1 Random Semi Rare or Rare OCP Gear<br>
1 Random Rare OCP Gear<br>
4 Bloody Branches<br>
4 HE Bubble Gum

Current box rates will stay about the same. So Steps 5 and 10 give increased rates.

